---
/** 오답 복습 카드 */
---
<article class="hub-feature-card app-dashboard-hub-card" data-dashboard-card="review">
  <h2 class="type-subhead">오답 복습</h2>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted">우선 복습 = 같은 문제에 2회 이상 오답</p>
  <div class="app-dashboard-review-kpis" role="status">
    <p class="app-dashboard-review-kpi-line">
      우선 <strong data-review-priority-count>0</strong>문항 · 일반 <strong data-review-normal-count>0</strong>문항
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="app-dashboard-ratio-bar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span data-review-priority-bar style="width: 0%"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted" data-review-empty hidden>오답이 아직 없어요. 틀린 문제는 자동으로 노트에 쌓입니다.</p>
  <a
    class="gsg-btn-solid !min-h-0 !inline-flex !w-full !justify-center !px-4 !py-2.5 !text-sm app-dashboard-cta"
    data-review-cta
    href="/problems/wrong-note"
  >
    오답 노트 열기
  </a>
</article>
